{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13414","headline":"送周愿判官归岭南 · 姚系","name":"送周愿判官归岭南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早蝉望秋鸣，夜琴怨离声。\n眇然多异感，值子江山行。\n由来重义人，感激事纵横。\n往复念遐阻，淹留慕平生。\n晨奔九衢饯，暮始万里程。\n山驿风月榭，海门烟霞城。\n易绡泉源近，拾翠沙漵明。\n兰蕙一爲赠，贫交空复情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚系","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13414.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13414","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}